Formation autopilot: comment out two debug printf calls.

FsFormationAutopilot::MakeDecision printed its state and the distance to
its position on every step ("MakeDecision 272 INPOSITION" and a number),
filling the log during the opening demo's formation flying. Like the
other debug prints in the same file, they are now comments.

For YSCE 231e711. See docs/PORTING-NOTES.md in riscos-ysflight.

